{"t":"EBAY","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"eBay Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Internet Retail","employees":12300,"hq":"San Jose, CA, United States","website":"https://www.ebayinc.com","summary_en":"eBay Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates marketplace platforms that connect buyers and sellers in the United States, the United Kingdom, China, Germany, and internationally. Its marketplace platform includes its online marketplace at ebay.com, off-platform businesses, and the eBay suite of mobile apps. The company's platforms enable users to list, sell, buy, and pay various products. The company was founded in 1995 and is headquartered in San Jose, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"eBay Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국, 영국, 중국, 독일 및 국제적으로 구매자와 판매자를 연결하는 마켓플레이스 플랫폼을 운영합니다. 마켓플레이스 플랫폼에는 ebay.com의 온라인 마켓플레이스, 플랫폼 외부 비즈니스 및 eBay 모바일 앱 제품군이 포함됩니다. 회사의 플랫폼을 통해 사용자는 다양한 제품을 나열, 판매, 구매 및 지불할 수 있습니다. 이 회사는 1995년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 산호세에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":120.97,"mcap":53105831936.0,"pe":26.412664,"fpe":17.583437,"peg":1.6799,"ps":4.2848015,"pb":12.064425,"ev_ebitda":18.483,"div":1.02,"beta":1.273,"hi52":127.74,"lo52":78.03},"fin":{"rev":12394000384.0,"rev_g":0.137,"eps_g":-0.181,"gross":0.72172,"op":0.19214001,"net":0.16936001,"roe":0.46041,"fcf":1703500032.0,"cash":1975000064.0,"debt":7208999936.0,"de":163.395,"eps":4.58,"feps":6.87977},"own":{"short":0.035099998,"inst":0.94831,"insider":0.101619996},"analyst":{"n":27,"mean":126.74074,"median":133.0,"high":153.0,"low":71.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.5,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":8,"hold":18,"sell":2,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":8,"hold":18,"sell":2,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":8,"hold":17,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":8,"hold":17,"sell":3,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Argus Research","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action